			"Message": "refactor(Output): Configurable logging and streamlined declaration generation\n\nThis commit enhances the flexibility of the `Output` build tooling, which prepares the `Dependency/Microsoft/Dependency/Editor` source for consumption by `Cocoon`.\n\n- Introduced `Level` and `Meta` environment variables to `ESBuild.ts`, allowing dynamic control over log verbosity and metafile generation via environment configuration.\n- Refactored `Source/ESBuild/Microsoft/VSCode.ts` to remove a redundant `tsc` invocation, consolidating the `.d.ts` generation into a single `@playform/build` command.\n- Renamed the TypeScript config to `tsconfig.Declaration.json` and enabled `noImplicitAny` to enforce stricter type safety during the declaration generation process.\n\nImpact: This reduces build pipeline redundancy and allows for cleaner, production-ready artifact generation while ensuring high-fidelity type definitions for the extension host.",
			"SHA": "8f016b7f08f90a238786a745a297f926c6e34898"
		},
